# Rights-cleared research source files are private local inputs. The repository
# stores only their schema and operating instructions.
/_corpus/

# The exported gate corpus is real published scripts and the evidence packs
# behind them, and those packs are built from a paid match feed. This
# repository is public, so committing it would redistribute a licensed
# provider's data. The replay skips cleanly when the file is absent, so the
# regression loop works locally without the corpus ever being shared.
#
# One line to reverse if the corpus should be shared after all.
/src/lib/pundit/__fixtures__/gate-corpus.json

# Docs steward working files (control-center checkout and digest)
.steward/
